  "slug": "quick-spanish-rice",
  "name": "Quick Spanish Rice",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "This recipe for quick and easy Spanish rice mixes cooked rice with diced tomatoes, chili powder, and beef bouillon to accompany Mexican-inspired meals.",
  "cuisine": "Spanish",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Heat butter in a frying pan over medium heat; cook and stir onion, green bell pepper, celery, and garlic until slightly tender, 5 to 10 minutes. Stir tomatoes with juice, chili powder, beef bouillon granules, and salt into onion mixture; add rice. Simmer rice mixture, stirring occasionally, until heated through and flavors are blended, 15 to 20 minutes."
    }
  ],
